                  pdfaProperty:description="ISSN for an electronic version of the issue in which the resource occurs. &#xA;Permits publishers to include a second ISSN, identifying an electronic version of the issue in which the resource occurs (therefore e(lectronic)Issn. If used, prism:eIssn MUST contain the ISSN of the electronic version. See prism:issn. &#xA;"
